      "text": "Having regard to facts and circumstances of the case, while this court is not inclined to grant anticipatory bail, it is directed that in the event the Petitioner surrenders before the Court in seisin over the matter and moves a motion for bail, the learned court concerned shall pass appropriate order in accordance with law keeping in view the gravity of the offence and severity of punishment applying its wisdom independently either allowing or // 2 // rejecting the application and not being influenced by the direction issued herein.",
